Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,Why does this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.71,0:00:01.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,road stand
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.32,0:00:01.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,straight up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.19,0:00:03.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's a drawbridge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.14,0:00:04.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,and Chicago has
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.07,0:00:04.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,dozens of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.05,0:00:05.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Each half of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.64,0:00:06.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,the road weighs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.39,0:00:07.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,thousands of tons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.78,0:00:08.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,Yet two motors
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.77,0:00:09.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,no stronger than
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.81,0:00:10.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,a car's engine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.66,0:00:11.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,lift it in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.16,0:00:11.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,about a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.09,0:00:12.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,The secret is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.88,0:00:13.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,hidden in a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.47,0:00:13.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,pit under
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.99,0:00:14.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.78,0:00:15.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,A counterweight heavier
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:16.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,than the road
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.58,0:00:17.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,itself hangs behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.94,0:00:18.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,the pivot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.66,0:00:19.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,Like a seesaw
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.54,0:00:20.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,it balances the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.31,0:00:21.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,road almost perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.06,0:00:22.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,So the motors
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:23.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,only have to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.59,0:00:23.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,give it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:24.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,a nudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.64,0:00:25.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,As the road
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.45,0:00:25.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,tips up the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.99,0:00:27.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,counterweight\Nswings down
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.42,0:00:28.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,into the pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.33,0:00:28.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,That's why it's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.93,0:00:29.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,called a bascule,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.08,0:00:31.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,French for seesaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.42,0:00:31.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,And when the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:32.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,next ship comes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.13,0:00:33.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,up it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.35,0:00:33.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,goes again.
